cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite the release you used (release id and DOI) and state the model versions listed in its README."
type: dataset
title: "Risk Terminal country risk readings"
version: "2026.09"
date-released: "2026-09-08"
authors:
  - family-names: Batabyal
    given-names: Krishna
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository: "https://github.com/krishnabatabyal/risk-terminal-data"
url: "https://risk-terminal.com/data"
abstract: >-
  Daily country, regional and sub-national risk readings for 195 scored
  countries (201 tracked) and 9 regions, with the model version and parameter
  fingerprint stamped on every row. Readings describe current conditions at
  each row's timestamp; they are not predictions. Study design pre-registered
  at https://doi.org/10.17605/OSF.IO/2SVZF.
keywords:
  - political risk
  - geopolitics
  - country risk
  - conflict
  - panel data
  - open data
